+## Not For
+
+- **Production code** — spikes are disposable. If you're cleaning up a spike for production, you built the wrong thing.
+- **Research-only tasks** — if the answer is in the docs, just read them. Don't build.
+- **Full project planning** — use `writing-plans` or `plan` for structured implementation plans.
+- **Code review or verification** — use `requesting-code-review`.
+
